,"en":"but to serve Me? This is the straight path.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَنِ","en_gloss":"And that","transliteration":"wa-ani","verse_key":"36:61"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱعْبُدُونِى ۚ","en_gloss":"you worship Me","transliteration":"uʿ'budūnī","verse_key":"36:61"},{"pos":3,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"This","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"36:61"},{"pos":4,"ar":"صِرَٰطٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a Path","transliteration":"ṣirāṭun","verse_key":"36:61"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مُّسْتَقِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"Straight","transliteration":"mus'taqīmun","verse_key":"36:61"},{"pos":6,"ar":"٦١","en_gloss":"(61)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"36:61"}]},{"verse_key":"36:62","surah":36,"ayah":62,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ أَضَلَّ مِنكُمْ جِبِلًّا كَثِيرًا ۖ أَفَلَمْ تَكُونُوا۟ تَعْقِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He has led great numbers of you astray. Did you not use your reason?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"36:62"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَضَلَّ","en_gloss":"he led astray","transliteration":"aḍalla","verse_key":"36:62"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنكُمْ","en_gloss":"from you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"36:62"},{"pos":4,"ar":"جِبِلًّۭا","en_gloss":"a multitude","transliteration":"jibillan","verse_key":"36:62"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَثِيرًا ۖ","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"kathīran","verse_key":"36:62"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَفَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Then did not","transliteration":"afalam","verse_key":"36:62"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَكُونُوا۟","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"takūnū","verse_key":"36:62"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَعْقِلُونَ","en_gloss":"use reason","transliteration":"taʿqilūna","verse_key":"36:62"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٦٢","en_gloss":"(62)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"36:62"}]},{"verse_key":"36:63","surah":36,"ayah":63,"ar_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِۦ جَهَنَّمُ ٱلَّتِى كُنتُمْ تُوعَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So this is the Fire that you were warned against.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"هَـٰذِهِۦ","en_gloss":"This (is)","transliteration":"hādhihi","verse_key":"36:63"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَهَنَّمُ","en_gloss":"(the) Hell","transliteration":"jahannamu","verse_key":"36:63"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّتِى","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"allatī","verse_key":"36:63"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you were","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"36:63"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تُوعَدُونَ","en_gloss":"promised","transliteration":"tūʿadūna","verse_key":"36:63"},{"pos":6,"ar":"٦٣","en_gloss":"(63)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"36:63"}]},{"verse_key":"36:64","surah":36,"ayah":64,"ar_uthmani":"ٱصْلَوْهَا ٱلْيَوْمَ بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَكْفُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Enter it today, because you went on ignoring [my commands].’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱصْلَوْهَا","en_gloss":"Burn therein","transliteration":"iṣ'lawhā","verse_key":"36:64"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"today","transliteration":"l-yawma","verse_key":"36:64"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"because","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"36:64"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you used to","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"36:64"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَكْفُرُونَ","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"takfurūna","verse_key":"36:64"},{"pos":6,"ar":"٦٤","en_gloss":"(64)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"36:64"}]},{"verse_key":"36:65","surah":36,"ayah":65,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلْيَوْمَ نَخْتِمُ عَلَىٰٓ أَفْوَٰهِهِمْ وَتُكَلِّمُنَآ أَيْدِيهِمْ وَتَشْهَدُ أَرْجُلُهُم بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَكْسِبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On that Day We shall seal up their mouths, but their hands will speak to Us, and their feet bear witness to everything they have done.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"This Day","transliteration":"al-yawma","verse_key":"36:65"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَخْتِمُ","en_gloss":"We will seal","transliteration":"nakhtimu","verse_key":"36:65"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"[on]","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"36:65"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَفْوَٰهِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their mouths","transliteration":"afwāhihim","verse_